        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Camilla Luddington, Catherine, Duchess of Cambridge, Prince William, Stephanie Edwards, Jo Wilson, Roseanne\n- Works: Grey's Anatomy, Roseanne's Nuts, Lifetime TV film\n- Organizations: ABC, Lifetime\n- Places: Seattle Grace Mercy West Hospital, Grey Sloan Memorial Hospital\n- Roles: Catherine Middleton, Jo Wilson, surgical intern, resident\n\nFacts:\n- Roseanne's Nuts is a Lifetime reality show/docudrama that aired from July 13, 2011, to September 16, 2011.\n- Catherine, Duchess of Cambridge, was born Catherine Elizabeth \"Kate\" Middleton on 9 January 1982 and is the wife of Prince William, Duke of Cambridge.\n- Camilla Luddington is known for playing Catherine Middleton in a Lifetime TV film.\n- Camilla Luddington is also known for playing Jo Wilson in the ABC medical drama Grey's Anatomy.\n- Stephanie Edwards is introduced in Grey's Anatomy as a surgical intern at the fictional Seattle Grace Mercy West Hospital, which is later renamed Grey Sloan Memorial Hospital.\n- Stephanie Edwards advances to the resident level alongside fellow intern and friend Jo Wilson, who is played by Camilla Luddington.",
